WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.190
We have just visited Kunming,

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.130
the capital of Yunnan Province.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.020
After the study,

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.140
and on our way,

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:42.530
we stopped by the Xinghan Village,

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.590
a small town close to Kunming, to rest.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:48.810
(Xinghan Restaurant)

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:54.320
I'm stuffed.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:56.410
I can't have another bite.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:58.400
We ordered so much.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.550
Do we have enough money?

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.930
Don't worry.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.490
We worked hard to earn some money.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.360
There's still a lot left.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.630
Right.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.840
I have the money right here.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.020
It's... gone!

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:21.110
What? Where did you lose it?

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.610
Did you misplace it somewhere?

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.220
That's right!

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:25.890
Take off all your clothes!

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:26.630
Stop it!

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.040
Come on!

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.110
Stop!

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.740
I hope you aren't going to stiff us on the check.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:43.520
The Bridge of Love: Galaxy Noodles

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:47.840
Mao! Silang!

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.150
Don't be so rough!

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.260
We did lose the money.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:54.380
We had no intention to eat and run.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.460
That doesn't matter,

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.710
because you can't pay us anyway.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.030
Fine, go report us to the police then!

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.120
Whatever!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:01.130
Very well,

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:02.720
if that's what you wish!

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.790
We don't have to involve the police.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:06.800
Mr. Harry.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.650
It's a serious crime

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.230
to eat a dish cooked by

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.490
a Senior Chef for free.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.340
You must be taught a lesson.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.400
Put them in a bag

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.580
and throw them in the river!

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:26.340
Mao!

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.200
Wait!

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.410
Come on, they're only children!

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:34.240
Eagle!

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.340
Are you saying

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:36.860
we should let kids eat for free?

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.020
No. But you can't beat them up!

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:41.680
You're so considerate.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.030
A third-level cook.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.240
I don't have to listen to you!

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.520
Get back to work

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:50.350
and cook for tomorrow's wedding!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.420
Wait, wait!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:55.690
You can't run away...

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.660
Slow down!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.590
Get back here!

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:08.610
Take that!

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:12.320
You brat!

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.300
Catch him!

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.510
Master Yang has arrived!

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:19.880
Lady Laya is with him.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:33.060
Laya...

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:36.050
Welcome you two!

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.850
Master Yang and Lady Laya.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:39.090
If only you informed me earlier,

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:41.390
I could have picked you up.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.230
It's okay.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.700
We're just dropping by.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:44.480
Later,

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:45.630
We just have to visit a few people

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.970
before tomorrow's wedding.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:49.720
I apologize

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:50.900
for not being able to come along.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.500
I can't just leave the restaurant unattended

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:54.320
just because of personal business.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.090
Did you hear that, Laya?

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.430
He thinks so responsibly,

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.470
as a head chef leading the restaurant.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.480
Yes.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.420
He's a great Senior Chef.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.430
I was right to

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.280
have chosen him for you.

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.950
Harry, please take good care of

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.040
Laya and Xinghan Restaurant.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.380
Sir, you can count on me!

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:18.950
Lady Laya.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.340
Congratulations on your marriage.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:25.870
Lady Laya.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.040
I can't wait to see you

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.570
in a wedding dress.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.810
I'm so happy!

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.050
One of my wishes comes true.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.790
Hey, who's that old guy?

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.130
You, watch your mouth!

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.470
He is a famous person in our village.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:46.930
He is also the owner of Xinghan Restaurant.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.150
Master Yang.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:49.320
Oh, I see.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.490
Hey, old man.

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:51.920
You!

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.820
Since you're the owner of the restaurant,

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.850
you can settle this easily.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.010
Who is this kid?

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.430
He's one of the naughty children

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.030
who tried to run off without paying.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:02.750
How many times do I have to say?

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:04.790
We're not running away!

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:05.880
Master Yang,

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.300
I promise to pay for what we ate.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.490
So please, let us work for you.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.810
We'll wash the dishes, or do whatever you want!

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.170
Please agree with that.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:16.960
You're in the Master's presence.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.200
Back off!

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:19.570
Wait.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.360
I think it's not the right time for causing trouble.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.040
We do need people to help us prepare for the wedding.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.760
We are undermanned.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.010
You can come to my house later.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.290
Yeah.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.750
What a great idea, sir.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:33.710
What a kiss ass.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.430
I'll see you tomorrow at the wedding!

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:40.870
Yes, Master Yang and Miss Laya.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.380
Thank you, Eagle.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:02.540
It all worked out.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.900
Thank you, Mr. Third-Level Cook!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.900
You shouldn't call him that!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:09.110
Stupid.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.210
Thanks for helping.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.140
I made you some refreshments.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.440
Please have some.

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.480
Meat buns!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.000
I'm gonna eat.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:31.410
How is it?

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:32.910
It's quite tasty.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:33.730
Miss Laya,

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:35.350
I bet you will be

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.420
a great wife.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.550
Oh, thank you.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:38.760
But why are you marrying

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.200
such a boring man?

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:43.780
Don't you deserve a better man?

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:48.420
Miss Laya.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.410
Maybe I said something wrong.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:06.620
Miss Laya.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.150
I'm sorry. Please don't mind me.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.280
What a beautiful scene.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.170
Yeah.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.440
Looking at this view

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:19.620
makes me feel serene.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:21.970
Miss Laya.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.330
Yes?

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:25.850
Can I ask you a question?

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.700
Sure, go ahead.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:29.030
I assume...

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:31.900
You are in love with someone else?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.220
I hope you don't mind my asking that.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.200
That river...

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.390
It's called the \"Small Galaxy\".

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:41.430
Small Galaxy?

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.220
What a romantic name!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.030
Last year, at the night of Qixi,

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.320
we were on that bridge.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:55.880
Laya,

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.930
when I make enough money,

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.290
I'd like to give you some pearls.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.030
Would you accept it?

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.000
I do.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.730
I'll be looking forward to that day, Eagle.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.710
This village is far away from the ocean,

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.210
so pearls are very rare.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.540
They also represent love.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.020
So, that was Eagle's way of professing

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.710
his vow of eternal love to me.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.130
He wanted to propose.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.030
But a while after that,

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.270
Harry, a senior chef,

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.330
came to our restaurant.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:25.530
His title

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.040
impressed my father.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.250
He decided to let Harry

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.690
in charge of the kitchen.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:30.190
He even planned to

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.910
let him marry me.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.730
Laya, you will take Harry as your husband.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.050
You must not see Eagle again.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:40.440
Eagle

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:42.960
will support your marriage

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:43.540
to Harry.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:44.840
After all,

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:47.630
he is just a third-level chef.

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:49.300
So he cannot inherit Xinghan Restaurant.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.440
I think Eagle understands

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:52.650
his position.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.520
Even if your father wanted it,

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:56.470
you shouldn't have to

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.220
marry a man you don't love.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.870
For all these years,

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.540
my father has raised me singlehandedly.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.530
I don't want to go against him.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:05.440
Since then,

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:07.310
Eagle started to avoid me.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.060
He doesn't even want to look at me.

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:12.070
So, how about the pearls he promised?

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:15.800
I have thought about it.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.110
I will listen to my father's order

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:19.010
and marry Harry.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:20.870
Miss Laya...

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.730
Although she says she's fine with it,

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:46.570
I wonder if she secretly regrets.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:48.990
But why did Eagle

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:49.980
back out?

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:51.360
It's quite simple,

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.320
he didn't truly love

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.540
Miss Laya.

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.670
This is amazing!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.110
Who carved this?

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:06.060
Eagle did.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.170
He's pretty skilled, for a third-level cook!

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.650
But I feel sorry for Eagle.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.340
He couldn't marry Lady Laya.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:15.090
And...

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:16.790
He's a nice guy.

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:17.930
Where is Eagle?

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.510
He quitted his job.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.650
He left.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.490
He left this as a parting gift

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.130
for Lady Laya.

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.420
But why he...

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:30.820
In fact,

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.650
Eagle still has feelings for her!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.070
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.400
Naughty!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:56.930
You're getting married tomorrow!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.180
Can you still stay here?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:01.040
It's my last night as a bachelor!

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:02.450
Harry.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.340
Things go so smoothly.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:05.050
Harry.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.040
You have a beautiful bride.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.180
You also get Xinghan Restaurant.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.340
An old man and a naive girl

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.450
sheltered from the real world.

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:15.520
It was so easy to tame them.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:16.740
You bad boy.

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.110
I'll turn Xinghan Restaurant

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.240
into a high-class bar,

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.810
and make lots of money!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:29.250
We can join you too!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:30.530
Sure thing!

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:31.930
Okay, let's get drunk

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.170
and celebrate!

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.210
My treat!

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:35.740
Harry!

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:37.870
Eagle.

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:39.720
You bastard!

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:40.950
Eagle,

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:41.790
why are you still here?

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.590
Get out of my sight!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:44.770
You jerk.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.110
Whatever you do is useless.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.220
The restaurant will be mine tomorrow!

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:51.090
Understand?

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:53.100
Jerk!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:54.040
Wait!

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:56.290
Out of the way!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:05.570
Mr. Third-Level Cook!

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:09.360
Excuse me.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:13.750
Eagle!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:14.730
Pull yourself together!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:21.230
This is...

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.080
Ouch...

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.260
Take it like a man!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.020
Okay.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.480
Eagle,

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:30.050
What's this?

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.430
Did you buy that

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.430
as a present for Miss Laya?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.750
How did you know?

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:39.830
I'm sorry.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.650
Miss Laya told us the whole story.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:42.910
Why did you do it?

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:44.870
Running away from Miss Laya?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:49.850
Laya.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.460
No, Lady

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.180
would have a better future

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.110
if she marries a senior chef

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.490
instead of me.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:58.970
So, you don't

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.390
hate her at all?

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.560
I would never hate her!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.230
But I didn't expect that

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.880
Harry is such a cruel man.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.580
It's too late to do anything now.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.670
The wedding is tomorrow.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.600
Are you crazy?

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.140
You sounded like you don't care.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:16.390
Think a solution!

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:17.970
That does not help.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:18.840
Laya said

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:21.200
she would forget about Eagle.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:22.930
I feel very sorry for Laya

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.550
if she does that.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.450
Do something, Mao.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:28.630
Eagle.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.630
Can you lend me that pearl bangle?

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.860
What's your plan, Mao?

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:37.600
Since a dish brings happiness,

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:38.850
well...

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.880
It may also be able to detect

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:44.010
and confirm happiness in people!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:05.850
Master Yang,

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:07.400
looks like you chose a good heir.

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:09.490
Your restaurant will develop so well.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.510
Dear honored guests...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.070
Thank you all for coming to witness the wedding

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.870
between my daughter, Laya, and Harry.

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.110
The ceremony is about to start.

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:23.520
Laya,

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:26.480
give the ring to the groom.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:31.900
What's wrong, Laya?

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:33.380
Yes.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.230
Thank you for waiting!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.140
Miss Laya,

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.510
someone asked us to

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.220
deliver this in celebration of your wedding.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.180
Someone?

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:05.890
What's going on...

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.030
What are you doing here?

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:09.950
Silang, okay?

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:10.870
Okay!

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:14.000
Here it is, Mao's special noodles!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:17.940
What?

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.920
Just black soup.

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:22.420
Don't ruin this, brats.

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:23.610
Serving inauspicious black soup

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.670
to my wedding?

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:25.790
Silang! Meili!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:26.940
Okay!

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:31.200
Here it goes!

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:38.590
What?

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:39.990
What are they doing?

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:49.750
A universe!

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.610
A galaxy of stars glowing on the table!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.130
Countless stars

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.960
are twinkling in a huge bowl.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:56.650
Looking down on a starry night.

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:57.950
What a magnificent view!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.600
It's innovative!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:00.580
Is that a real dish?

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:01.690
Yes.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.650
These are my special Galaxy Noodles!

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:05.370
Galaxy Noodles?

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:08.760
Two bright stars located at
the opposite ends of the Milky Way

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.150
are the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.020
They are parted by the Milky Way

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.810
and can only see each other for one day each year.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.550
But their love never ceases.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.540
We celebrate their reunion every year on Qixi.

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:18.820
I understand.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.850
It's a celebrating dish

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.130
hoping the couple can be in love forever.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:23.950
I don't know who sent it.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.370
But it means a lot.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:27.000
Can it be?

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.770
What a deep and mysterious flavor!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.930
The black soup is made from squid ink.

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.390
It melds perfectly with the

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.690
smooth and elastic noodles.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.560
I cannot stop eating it.

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:45.990
I wonder

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.420
what the twinkling stars

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.370
on the soup surface are.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.350
That's made from pearl powder.

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:52.870
Pearls!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.620
Unbelievable.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.010
How did you get them?

00:17:58.630 --> 00:17:59.310
Well,

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.450
this came from a pearl bangle

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:01.420
Eagle bought for you,

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.840
as he promised.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:06.830
Eagle...

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:09.480
I'm sorry.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:10.940
I broke off two or three pearls

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.280
for the soup.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:17.360
Brat, what is the meaning of this?

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:18.490
Master Yang,

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:20.830
a Senior Chef title does not

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:21.870
automatically make someone

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.030
a wonderful cook.

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.280
This man's purpose was to seize control

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:27.910
over your restaurant!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:28.870
What?

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:31.150
What nonsense are you blabbering?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.430
Master Yang,

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:35.220
would you trust the words of a boy

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.590
even if you don't know his identity?

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:39.910
He is not a nobody!

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:43.490
(Super)

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:44.780
What?

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:46.470
God...

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:53.560
He's the youngest Super Chef in history...

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:55.510
Liu Mao Xing!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.060
A Super Chef!

00:18:58.410 --> 00:18:59.770
How's that?

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.730
Do you trust him now?

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:02.810
Harry,

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:04.220
you'd better explain.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.720
Oh man.

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:08.020
I was so close to winning the

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.530
grand prize...

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:10.340
Harry!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.630
Mao, I apologize.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.950
I said that I was doing this for Laya's sake,

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:40.970
but I only cared for

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.300
my restaurant.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:44.340
I'm so ashamed of myself.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.310
Master Yang,

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.790
please look at that.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.580
I was wondering

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:50.350
what that was...

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:09.040
Mr. Eagle made this

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:10.990
for Miss Laya.

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.280
What? This was done by Eagle?

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.060
In your restaurant,

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.390
there's talents who

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.460
have a potential no less than that of a Senior Chef!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:19.090
Right?

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:20.860
Mao's comments

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:21.770
never go wrong.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:22.770
That's right.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:24.880
Laya.

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:26.320
Miss Laya.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.110
Eagle's waiting for you at the place

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.670
where he

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:31.530
promised you the pearls.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:32.520
Just go!

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:40.900
Eagle!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:41.850
Eagle!

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:49.920
Eagle!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:00.560
Laya.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:12.680
- Eagle!
- Laya!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:15.530
Funny.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.650
I cried so much that I thought I have no more tears.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:27.670
How pretty!

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.810
The river is reflecting lots of stars!

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:30.870
They are glittering.

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.750
That's why people call it the Small Galaxy.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:35.410
How romantic.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.210
Eternal happiness

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:39.150
for lovers.

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:40.110
Isn't it a great idea?

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:43.040
I wish someone would

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:44.090
give me such a bangle...

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:46.640
Look, Mao!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:48.710
The stars are so beautiful!

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:18.120
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:20.148
The taste training is coming to an end,

00:23:20.148 --> 00:23:22.400
and Guangzhou where I've long been missing
is just around the corner.

00:23:22.442 --> 00:23:23.902
The last town we stopped at was,

00:23:24.028 --> 00:23:25.737
to our surprise,

00:23:25.862 --> 00:23:27.780
a town full of chickens.

00:23:28.197 --> 00:23:30.033
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.116 --> 00:23:31.784
The Black Chicken of Misfortune

00:23:31.951 --> 00:23:33.328
It will definitely be interesting!
